   "stem": {
      "text": "A drone moves in the xy-plane so that its position at time t is \\( (x(t), y(t)) = \\left(3 t + \\ln{\\left(t^{2} + 1 \\right)}, 6 e^{- \\frac{t^{2}}{4}}\\right) \\) for \\( t \\ge 0 \\). Using a calculator, find the slope of the line tangent to the path of the drone at \\( t = \\frac{3}{2} \\). Show the setup for the calculation, and give the value correct to three decimal places.",
